---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Resume | Shlok Mehndiratta"
  description="Curriculum Vitae and Resume of Shlok Mehndiratta. Senior undergraduate in EECS at IISER Bhopal."
>
  <div class="space-y-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Header with Action Buttons -->
    <header class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-6 border-b border-black/[0.08] dark:border-white/[0.08]">
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">
          Shlok Mehndiratta
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
          Resume / Curriculum Vitae • Updated October 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 print:hidden">
        <button
          onclick="window.print()"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-black/[0.1] dark:border-white/[0.1] text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100/70 dark:bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 17h2a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h6a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2zm8-12V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4h10z"></path></svg>
          <span>Print / PDF</span>
        </button>

        <a
          href="/cv.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          download
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-100 dark:text-zinc-900 text-xs font-mono font-medium hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-white transition-colors"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
          <span>Download LaTeX PDF</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Resume Body -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
      <!-- Contact Info -->
      <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        <div>
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> contact@shlokmehndiratta.me</p>
          <p><strong>Institution:</strong> IISER Bhopal, India</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sm:text-right">
          <p><strong>Website:</strong> https://shlokmehndiratta.me</p>
          <p><strong>GitHub:</strong> github.com/shlokmehndiratta</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Education -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-1.5">
          Education
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Indian Institute of Science Education and Research (IISER) Bhopal</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">2022 – 2026 (Expected)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
            Bachelor of Science (BS) in Electrical Engineering and Computer Science (EECS)
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 font-mono">
            Key Coursework: Signals & Systems, Linear Algebra, Convex Optimization, Graph Theory, Digital Signal Processing, Probability & Random Processes, Data Structures & Algorithms, Computer Architecture.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Research & Industry Experience -->
      <section class="space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-1.5">
          Appointments & Experience
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">IISER Bhopal — Undergraduate Thesis Researcher</h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">Aug 2025 – Present</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">Advisor: Faculty Advisor • Dept. of EECS</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-1 space-y-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              <li>Formulated continuous-time manifold regularization for recursive estimation on dynamic graphs.</li>
              <li>Proved analytical mean-squared error bounds under noisy edge-weight perturbations (42% MSE reduction).</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Visiting Research Fellow — Autonomous Systems Lab</h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">May 2025 – Jul 2025</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">Host Lab PI: Senior Professor</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-1 space-y-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              <li>Developed an asynchronous consensus protocol for multi-robot formations under packet drops.</li>
              <li>Engineered a C++20/ROS 2 event-driven distributed simulator for 50+ nodes with zero deadlock.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Engineering & Software Intern — Applied Systems Track</h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">Dec 2024 – Jan 2025</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">Systems & Optimization Team</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-1 space-y-1 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              <li>Accelerated matrix factorization routines using SIMD vectorization and C++ profiling.</li>
              <li>Integrated streaming sensor telemetry with sub-millisecond latency bounds.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Publications & Manuscripts -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-1.5">
          Publications & Preprints
        </h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
          <div>
            <p class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-medium">
              1. <strong>Shlok Mehndiratta</strong>, Research Advisor Name.
            </p>
            <p class="italic text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              "Adaptive State Estimation in High-Dimensional Dynamic Graphs"
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">
              Under review at <em>IEEE Transactions on Signal and Information Processing over Networks</em>, 2026.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-medium">
              2. <strong>Shlok Mehndiratta</strong>, Collaborator Name, Senior PI.
            </p>
            <p class="italic text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              "Sparse Signal Reconstruction via Non-Convex Spectral Proximal Operators"
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">
              Proceedings of the <em>IEEE International Conference on Acoustics, Speech, and Signal Processing (ICASSP)</em>, 2025.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-medium">
              3. <strong>Shlok Mehndiratta</strong>, Host Lab Mentor.
            </p>
            <p class="italic text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
              "Decentralized Learning in Asynchronous Multi-Agent Robotic Networks"
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 font-mono">
              arXiv preprint arXiv:2508.00000, 2025.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Technical Skills -->
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-mono font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-1.5">
          Technical Proficiencies
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
          <p><strong class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Languages:</strong> Python, C/C++ (C++20), Julia, MATLAB, LaTeX, Bash</p>
          <p><strong class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Libraries:</strong> PyTorch, NumPy, SciPy, Eigen, NetworkX, CVXPY, ROS 2</p>
          <p><strong class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Hardware & Labs:</strong> Digital Oscilloscopes, Function Generators, Spectrum Analyzers, STM32</p>
          <p><strong class="font-mono text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Tools:</strong> Linux, Git, Docker, Neovim, CMake</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
